{"4050430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "What Is Going On?", "steam_appid": 4050430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“What is going on?”</strong> is a new style of horror game that combines <i>anomaly detection</i> with <i>survival horror</i>.<br>Use your flashlight and CCTV to protect your home, detect incoming threats, and eliminate them before it’s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Tension</strong>: Your flashlight battery drains quickly but recharges slowly. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Nights of Survival</strong>: Face increasingly dangerous threats as the atmosphere shifts from day to night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Enemies</strong>: Special enemies interfere with your cameras or disable your flashlight, testing your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immediate Danger</strong>: Some enemies break into your room—if you don’t hide under the bed in time, it’s game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Horror Experience</strong>: Blending the anomaly-spotting gameplay  with the CCTV survival horror. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide &amp; Fight:</strong> Fight when they are not close to you, but hide when they are close to your room. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“What is going on?”</strong> is a new style of horror game that combines <i>anomaly detection</i> with <i>survival horror</i>.<br>Use your flashlight and CCTV to protect your home, detect incoming threats, and eliminate them before it’s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Tension</strong>: Your flashlight battery drains quickly but recharges slowly. Use it wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Nights of Survival</strong>: Face increasingly dangerous threats as the atmosphere shifts from day to night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Enemies</strong>: Special enemies interfere with your cameras or disable your flashlight, testing your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immediate Danger</strong>: Some enemies break into your room—if you don’t hide under the bed in time, it’s game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Horror Experience</strong>: Blending the anomaly-spotting gameplay  with the CCTV survival horror. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide &amp; Fight:</strong> Fight when they are not close to you, but hide when they are close to your room. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "“What is going on?” is a anomaly detection &amp; survival horror game. Players take the role of a lone resident who must endure five nights, using limited flashlight and CCTV to survive. Strange anomalies and entities invade the home, and the player must detect, defend, and hide to stay alive.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050430/88b694bd6bf64a2624a255d5dc3f9742ab5a95b6/header.jpg?t=1760625739", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050430/59dddff0f9511371269f27d5c64fdd3de495fe4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760625739", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050430/59dddff0f9511371269f27d5c64fdd3de495fe4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760625739", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 / 10 / 11 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Vers